# SKYWELL: the best floor, most cogs, most keys and items bought are kept
# between runs.
game skywell
wait 5
press A
cheat cogs 7
cheat top 9
cheat keys 1
cheat cogs 20
cheat shop
cheat offer 3 3 3
wait 30
press A
expect items_bought == 1
press B
wait 5
cheat top 9
cheat pos 100 60
wait 20
expect state == 2
expect best_floor == 39
reload
game skywell
wait 5
expect best_floor == 39
expect most_keys == 1
expect items_bought == 1
